title: 2032
subtitle: A new year
tags: event
view-if: year = 2032 and month = 1
priority: 2
max-visits: 1

A new year begins. [? if unemployment_rate >= 8 : Unemployment is still far too high, and many people no longer believe that politics can change it. ?][? if unemployment_rate < 8 and unemployment_rate >= 6 : The economy is moving, but slowly. ?][? if unemployment_rate < 6 : The labour market is in good shape, and companies are once again complaining about a shortage of skilled workers. ?]
